<title>JAPAN: Japan finance minister to visit S.Korea Aug 28-29.</title>
<headline>Japan finance minister to visit S.Korea Aug 28-29.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese Finance Minister Hiroshi Mitsuzuka plans to visit South Korea from August 28 to 29 for talks with his counterpart in that country, the ministry said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>A ministry official said the finance ministers plan to discuss the economic situation in their respective countries and Asian economic and financial matters.</p>
</text>
